=============================
Git Exercise - Cognizant
=============================

Step 1: Setup Git Configuration

1. Check Git Version
git --version

2. Configure Username
git config --global user.name "Sahil Tanwar"

3. Configure Email
git config --global user.email "your_email@gmail.com"

4. Verify Configuration
git config --global --list


=============================
Step 2: Configure Notepad
=============================

1. Check Notepad++
notepad++

2. Open .bashrc
notepad++ ~/.bashrc

3. Add Alias
alias np='notepad++'

4. Reload Bash
source ~/.bashrc

5. Open Notepad++ using Alias
np

6. Set Notepad++ as Default Editor
git config --global core.editor "notepad++"

7. Verify Default Editor
git config --global -e


=============================
Step 3: Add File to Repository
=============================

1. Create Project Folder
mkdir GitDemo

2. Move into Project
cd GitDemo

3. Initialize Git
git init

4. View Hidden Files
ls -la

5. Create File
echo "Welcome to Git" > welcome.txt

6. Check File
ls

7. View File Content
cat welcome.txt

8. Check Git Status
git status

9. Add File
git add welcome.txt

10. Commit File
git commit

11. Check Status
git status

12. Add Remote Repository
git remote add origin https://gitlab.com/username/GitDemo.git

13. Pull Repository
git pull origin master

14. Push Repository
git push origin master
